<view class="page">
  <scroll-view class="settings-content" scroll-y enable-flex>
    <view class="eyebrow">班级配置</view>
    <view class="heading-line"><view class="heading">班级与科目设置</view><text wx:if="{{className}}" class="class-name">当前班级：{{className}}</text></view>
    <view class="intro">保存后，录入页会同步班级人数和可选科目。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sync-hint">正在读取云端设置…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{!settingsReady}}" class="sync-hint">云端设置读取失败<button class="secondary-button retry-button" bindtap="load">重新读取</button></view>
    <view class="card setting-card">
      <view class="field-label">班级人数</view>
      <view class="size-line"><input class="size-input" type="number" value="{{classSize}}" bindinput="onSizeInput" maxlength="3" disabled="{{saving || !settingsReady}}" /><text>人</text></view>
      <view class="hint">支持 1–200 人，学号从 01 开始顺序生成</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card setting-card subjects-card">
      <view class="field-label">科目设置</view>
      <view class="subject-add"><input class="subject-input" type="text" value="{{subjectDraft}}" placeholder="输入科目名称" maxlength="30" bindinput="onSubjectInput" disabled="{{saving || !settingsReady}}" /><button class="secondary-button add-button" bindtap="onAddSubject" disabled="{{saving || !settingsReady}}">添加</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!subjects.length}}" class="hint">暂无科目，请添加后保存</view>
      <view wx:for="{{subjects}}" wx:key="*this" class="subject-row"><text class="subject-name">{{item}}</text><button class="remove-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRemoveSubject" disabled="{{saving || !settingsReady}}">删除</button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip-card"><view class="tip-icon">i</view><view>点击“保存设置”后同步到云端。删除科目不会改变已保存的历史成绩。</view></view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="bottom-area"><button class="primary-button" bindtap="save" loading="{{loading || saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !settingsReady}}">保存设置</button></view>
</view>
